type:
∀ {α : Type u} {r : Demo.Rel α} {a : α} {motive : (a_1 : α) → r.TransGen a a_1 → Prop} {b c : α}
  (a_1 : r.TransGen a b) (a_2 : r b c),
  Demo.Rel.TransGen.below a_1 → motive b a_1 → Demo.Rel.TransGen.below ⋯

∀ {α : Type u} {r : Demo.Rel α} {a : α} {motive : (a_1 : α) → r.ReflTransGen a a_1 → Prop} {a_1 : α}
  (t : r.ReflTransGen a a_1),
  motive a ⋯ → (∀ {b c : α} (a_2 : r.ReflTransGen a b) (a_3 : r b c), motive c ⋯) → motive a_1 t

∀ {α : Type u} {r : Demo.Rel α} {a : α} {motive : (a_1 : α) → r.TransGen a a_1 → Prop} {a_1 : α}
  (t : r.TransGen a a_1),
  (∀ (a_2 : α) (t : r.TransGen a a_2), Demo.Rel.TransGen.below t → motive a_2 t) → motive a_1 t

∀ {α : Type u} {r : Demo.Rel α} {a : α} {motive : (a_1 : α) → r.ReflTransGen a a_1 → Prop} {b c : α}
  (a_1 : r.ReflTransGen a b) (a_2 : r b c),
  Demo.Rel.ReflTransGen.below a_1 → motive b a_1 → Demo.Rel.ReflTransGen.below ⋯

doc:
Fuel-bounded depth-first search: `g.searchWithin fuel s t` is `true` when the search finds a
path from `s` to `t` using at most `fuel` edges. With no fuel left it only checks `s = t`;
otherwise it also tries every successor of `s` with one unit of fuel less.
